        {
          "text": "它为什么猜得准？因为读得多。",
          "en": "Why does it guess so well? It has read a lot."
        },
        {
          "text": "一个人读一辈子，可能不到它的万分之一。",
          "en": "A lifetime of human reading is barely a ten-thousandth of it."
        },
        {
          "text": "它记住的不是答案，而是[g]文字之间的规律[/g]。",
          "en": "It doesn't memorise answers — it learns patterns between words."
        }
