      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "大模型里有个旋钮，叫“温度”。",
          "en": "There's a dial inside, called temperature."
        },
        {
          "text": "调低，它总挑最稳的那个：靠谱，但无聊。",
          "en": "Turn it down: it always picks the safest word. Reliable, but dull."
        },
        {
          "text": "调高，冷门的词也有机会：更有创意，也更容易跑偏。",
          "en": "Turn it up: long shots get a chance. More creative — and more likely to drift."
        }
      ]
