          "text": "问它一件不存在的事，它也能一本正经地编完。",
          "en": "Ask about something that never happened, and it will still answer with a straight face."
        },
        {
          "text": "这就是大模型的[r]“幻觉”[/r]。",
          "en": "That's what we call hallucination."
        }
